menu "High Boy prototype deployment"
config HIGHBOY_BOARD_V203
    bool "604858 battery guard for prototype 0201891B"
    default n
    help
        Preserve the measured 2000 mAh pack limits, fresh ADC validation and
        low-voltage charge inhibition. This does not qualify cell temperature.

config HIGHBOY_V203_CPU_200M
    bool "Conservative 200 MHz startup for prototype 0201891B"
    depends on HIGHBOY_BOARD_V203 && !PM_ENABLE
    default n
    help
        Apply the tested CPU divider before scheduler startup. Retain both
        cores, watchdogs and memory protection.
endmenu
